  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "應用美學",
    "sub_ename": "APPLIED AESTHETICS",
    "describe_ch": "從台灣前輩書家的嘗試與創新談起，兼論日本書道、中國民間書法之美學與藝術，體會漢字的美學與運用，並瞭解新媒體、行動藝術、裝置藝術之美。",
    "describe_eh": "Starting from the attempts and innovations of predecessor calligraphers in Taiwan, discussing the aesthetics and art of Japanese calligraphy and Chinese folk calligraphy, experiencing the aesthetics and use of Chinese characters, and understanding the beauty of new media, action art, and installation art.",
